        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "20-1. PREPARATION PERIOD—Each teacher is to have an uninterrupted preparation period each day, when possible. The practice of using a regular teacher as a substitute, thereby depriving him of his preparation period, is undesirable and shall be done only in an emergency where regular substitutes are not available. Regular teachers shall first be assigned on a voluntary basis during their non-teaching time, prior to assignment on a rotating basis.",
